Linux kernel uapi headers (v6.12), GPL-2.0 WITH Linux-syscall-note.
  - include/lkd/syscall_nr.h and src/core/syscall_names.c are generated from
    arch/x86/entry/syscalls/syscall_64.tbl (the copy and its sha256 are in tools/data/ and in the header).
  - include/lkd/abi_x64.h restates the numeric ABI (constants and structure layouts) of the x86-64 uapi.
    The uapi headers carry the Linux-syscall-note exception for exactly this use.

